As some of you may know, MIT host a yearly event called the Mystery Hunt.
It involves lots of puzzles and is a fun event in my opinion. The last hunt
featured a puzzle involving lojban.

Here is a link:
http://web.mit.edu/puzzle/www/2013/coinheist.com/rubik/lojicomix/index.html

I encourage you to try to solve the puzzle (It was written with the intent
that people who did not know lojban before starting the puzzle be able to
figure it out) before clicking on the solution link, and not to spoil the
solution publicly on the mailing list.


